<title>FINLAND: Key Aamulehti, MTV figures.</title>
<headline>Key Aamulehti, MTV figures.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aamulehti-yhtyma Oy gave the following figures for itself and commercial television group MTVOy, with which it said it planned to merge (million markka unless stated) :</p>
<p>    Aamulehti-yhtym		1996   1995    1994   1993</p>
<p> Net sales			   1,623  1,433   1,412  1,363</p>
<p> Operating profit		    178    122     103     65</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax	 155     87	62    -21</p>
<p> Balance sheet total	     1,603  1,417   1,479  1,346</p>
<p> EPS (undiluted) (markka)	16.04  11.91    9.35  -3,73</p>
<p> Dividend (markka)		  3.00   2.50    0.50	0</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI) (pct) 17     12	11	7</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (pct)     18     16	15     -7</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)     45     41	30     24</p>
<p> Workforce			   3,029  2,562   2,827  3,185</p>
<p>    MTV				 1996   1995   1994    1993</p>
<p> Net sales			     975    950    810     709</p>
<p> Operating profit		     64     80     53	29</p>
<p> Profit before extras, tax	  80     97     63	37</p>
<p> Balance sheet total		 532    491    435     374</p>
<p> EPS (markka)			1.043  1.305    837     440</p>
<p> Dividend (markka)		   250    250    165     125</p>
<p> Return on investment (ROI) (pct) 24     34     25	16</p>
<p> Return on equity (ROE) (pct)     18     27     20	13</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (pct)     67     64     57	56</p>
<p> Workforce			     644    633     614    602</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 240, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
